    "decay": {"10d_ic": 0.0148655240, "20d_ic": 0.0166527749, "40d_ic": 0.0407730540, "60d_ic": 0.0611251871},
    "regime_notes": "60D IC by regime: 2020-23 -0.000895; 2024-26 -0.0246427; 2027-29 +0.1132751; 2030-32 +0.2115121; 2033-34 +0.0615127. Results are based on 15 tradable cross-asset instruments, with approximately 9 valid instruments per date because volume is unavailable for some series; interpret uncertainty conservatively.",
